=== C. route_server + docking_server: graph and dock database ===
  [wait] /route_server/set_route_graph after 4.8s
  [services] edge services: (none)
  [services] dock services: ['/docking_server/reload_database']
$ ros2 service call /route_server/set_route_graph nav2_msgs/srv/SetRouteGraph graph_filepath=C:/maps/nope.geojson
